  "name": "Toward a Quantitative c_eff(a): Parameterization, Constraints, and Degeneracy-Breaking Tests",
  "description": "Parameterization of the effective cosmological propagation speed c_eff(a) = c_0[1 + epsilon*beta*T(a)] within EFC. Beta = 0.08 from BAO+RSD, epsilon is one free parameter. Two implementations (metric VSL, optical-medium) with four degeneracy-breaking tests and six falsification criteria.",
